  RED-GREEN-REFACTOR TDD-for-skills loop and anti-rationalization
  principle from upstream's `writing-skills` (adopt-with-edits per
  ADR-003 §2.4 — structure/principle borrowed, body 100% independently
  authored in buddy voice), and
- plugin/skills/decompose-blocker/PROCEDURE.md draws inspiration from
  upstream's `brainstorming` skill's forcing-question + design-thinking
  approach, though buddy's skill targets a narrower scope (code-work
  stuck state, not idea-to-design pipeline) and uses different
  decomposition primitives (fact/guess/unknown 3-classification,
  4D axes, cost-information matrix) — inspired-by per ADR-003 §2.4.

No verbatim code or text was adopted. buddy's implementation is
independently authored.

